    "welcome_message": "Welcome to the Example Booking Software community, a place for salon, clinic and studio owners to swap what works. Start with the house rules pinned here, then tell us in #introductions what you run and the one thing about bookings you'd change. A host will say hello within a day. Getting started guide: https://www.example.com/features/online-booking/?utm_source=slack&utm_medium=community&utm_campaign=start-here Still choosing a booking tool? Set up an account here: https://www.example.com/signup/?utm_source=slack&utm_medium=community&utm_campaign=welcome-message",
    "house_rules": [
      "This is for people who run or staff a booking-based business: talk about running it.",
      "Search before you ask, then one question per thread in #help so the answer can be found later.",
      "No selling, and no direct messages to members who didn't ask for one.",
      "Disagree with the idea, never the person.",
      "What's said here stays here: no screenshots of member posts outside the community.",
      "Report a problem to any moderator or in a direct message to Alex Rivera."
    ],
    "response_ladder": [
      "a private reminder",
      "a warning",
      "a 7-day timeout",
      "removal"
    ],
    "staff_rules": [
      "No sales pitches in direct messages.",
      "Member data never leaves the community."
    ],
